  <div class="card">
    <h2>Who can see what</h2>
    <dl class="facts">
      <dt>Admin users</dt><dd>Everything: plant, equipment, fleet, fuel cards and receipts, and employees. An admin can also be a fleet driver or site manager.</dd>
      <dt>Site managers</dt><dd>The plant and equipment on the projects assigned to them (set on Projects): view it, do check sheets and report defects. Plus their own vehicle and fuel card: walk-arounds, fuel and defects. Their own Dashboard and Calendar. They don't see prices, hire rates, fuel cards or employees.</dd>
      <dt>Site workers</dt><dd>Usually kept on the system with no login. If given one, the same as a fleet driver.</dd>
      <dt>Fleet drivers</dt><dd>Only the vehicles assigned to them: walk-around checks, fuel logs with their fuel cards, and defects.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
